Package: @PKG@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: default-jre-headless | java11-runtime-headless, curl, adduser, postgresql-client
Recommends: postgresql
Suggests: nginx
Section: web
Priority: optional
Description: Folien (presentations: edit, present, export)
 Creates, edits and presents slide decks in the browser: layouts in two
 designs (Folien and Kanton Zürich), text, shapes, images and videos,
 transitions and builds, a presenter console and a phone remote; exports
 as PDF, PowerPoint and self-contained zip bundles. A dabscm web
 application with its own Scheme runtime; needs PostgreSQL.
